s logo apparel, books, wall decors, photo merchandises, invitations and announcements, and others; website design and hosting, digital services, and email marketing services, as well as order referral and other third-party offerings. It serves various businesses, graphic designers, resellers, and printers, as well as teams, associations, groups, consumers, and families. Cimpress plc was founded in 1994 and is based in Dundalk, Ireland."}}